	(text "LAYOUT\n  - USBLC6 RIGHT AT the connector. With 10mm of trace, clamping\n    rises from 31V to 319V (USBLC6-2 Doc ID 11265, sec 2.2).\n  - D+/D- pass THROUGH U3 (in one pin, out the other).\n    Never a stub.\n  - Pair on TOP, referenced to the layer-2 GND plane.\n    No vias. 90 ohm differential.\n  - Continuous GND plane under the pair. No slots.\n  - VBUS away from D+/D- (AN4879 sec 3.3).\n  - GND via on U3 pin 2 pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100.838 96.012 0)
